Summary
Automated Approach (Recommended):

Configure SKIP_REPOS and ALLOWLIST_REPOS in rollout script
Run ./scripts/rollout-pr-qa-review.sh
Review and merge auto-created PRs in each repository

Manual Approach:

Create workflow file .github/workflows/pr-qa-review.yml in target repo
Commit, push, and create PR
Merge PR to enable workflow

Both approaches result in:

✅ Automatic PR reviews on every pull request
✅ Detailed code quality reports with severity levels
✅ Test coverage analysis and recommendations
✅ Slack notifications (if configured)
✅ Workflow blocking on critical issues (if enabled)
